2025-12-01T02:28:35.7555495Z === RUN   TestSLURMPathResolutionDocumentation
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7556520Z     slurm_path_test.go:106: === SLURM Output File Path Resolution Documentation ===
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7557230Z     slurm_path_test.go:107:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7558061Z     slurm_path_test.go:108: SLURM Job Submission Path Behavior:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7559014Z     slurm_path_test.go:109: 1. --chdir: Sets the job's working directory (where the job executes)
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7560036Z     slurm_path_test.go:110: 2. --output: Output file path (can be absolute or relative)
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7560974Z     slurm_path_test.go:111: 3. --error: Error file path (can be absolute or relative)
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7561694Z     slurm_path_test.go:112:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7562195Z     slurm_path_test.go:113: Janus Implementation:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7563224Z     slurm_path_test.go:114: • Working Directory: Set to filepath.Dir(modelPath) - model's directory
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7564390Z     slurm_path_test.go:115: • Output Files: Absolute paths = modelPath + '.slurm.out/err'
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7565136Z     slurm_path_test.go:116:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7565615Z     slurm_path_test.go:117: Why This Works:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7566666Z     slurm_path_test.go:118: • SLURM writes absolute paths to their exact locations
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7567774Z     slurm_path_test.go:119: • Relative paths would be resolved against the working directory
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7568889Z     slurm_path_test.go:120: • Using absolute paths ensures predictable file locations
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7569866Z     slurm_path_test.go:121:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7570376Z     slurm_path_test.go:122: File Watcher Behavior:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7571200Z     slurm_path_test.go:123: • Monitors the exact paths passed to SLURM
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7572127Z     slurm_path_test.go:124: • No path translation needed - direct 1:1 mapping
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7573108Z     slurm_path_test.go:125: • Works regardless of where Janus is running from
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7573777Z     slurm_path_test.go:129:
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7574402Z     slurm_path_test.go:130: Example with model: /project/models/analysis.mod
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7575172Z     slurm_path_test.go:131:   Job working dir: /project/models
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7575968Z     slurm_path_test.go:132:   Output file: /project/models/analysis.mod.slurm.out
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7577042Z     slurm_path_test.go:133:   Error file: /project/models/analysis.mod.slurm.err
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7577897Z     slurm_path_test.go:134:   File watcher monitors: Same absolute paths
2025-12-01T02:28:35.7578648Z --- PASS: TestSLURMPathResolutionDocumentation (0.00s)
